"hari haraye namaḥ kṛṣṇa yādavāya namaḥ","author":"Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"},"title":["Nām-saṅkīrtan"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["hari haraye namaḥ kṛṣṇa yādavāya namaḥ","yādavāya mādhavāya keśavāya namaḥ"],"translation":["O Lord, Kṛṣṇa, Yādava, Hari, Mādhava, Keśava, again and again I offer my obeisance to You."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["gopāla govinda rāma śrī madhusūdana","giridhārī gopīnātha madana-mohana"],"translation":["All glory to Gopāl, Govinda, Rām, Śrī Madhusūdan, Giridhārī, Gopīnāth, Madan Mohan!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["śrī-chaitanya nityānanda śrī advaitachandra","gadādhara śrīvāsādi gaura-bhakta-vṛnda"],"translation":["All glory to Śrī Chaitanya, Nityānanda, Advaitachandra, Gadādhar, Śrivās, and all the Lord’s devotees!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["jaya rūpa sanātana bhaṭṭa raghunātha","śrī-jīva gopāla-bhaṭṭa dāsa raghunātha"],"translation":["All glory to Śrī Rūpa, Sanātan, Raghunāth Bhaṭṭa, Śrī Jīva, Gopāl Bhaṭṭa, and Raghunāth Dās!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["ei chhaya gosāñi kari charaṇa vandana","yāhā haite vighna-nāśa abhīṣṭa-pūraṇa"],"translation":["I offer my obeisance to these six goswāmīs. By doing so, all obstacles are destroyed and all desires are fulfilled."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["ei chhaya gosāñi yā̐ra mu̐i tā̐ra dāsa","tā̐-sabāra pada-reṇu mora pañcha-grāsa"],"translation":["I am a servant of these six goswāmīs. Their foot dust is my","five forms of sustenance."],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["tā̐dera charaṇa sevi bhakta sane vāsa","janame janame mora ei abhilāṣa"],"translation":["To live with the devotees who serve their feet is my desire, birth after birth."],"isLong":false},{"number":"8","text":["ei chhaya gosāñi yabe vraje kailā vāsa","rādhā-kṛṣṇa-nitya-līlā karilā prakāśa"],"translation":["When these six goswāmīs lived in Vraja, they revealed Rādhā-Kṛṣṇa’s eternal Pastimes."],"isLong":false},{"number":"9","text":["ānande bala hari bhaja vṛndāvana","śrī-guru-vaiṣṇava-pade majāiyā mana"],"translation":["Joyfully chant, ‘Hari!’, and worship Vṛndāvan, meditating on the feet of Śrī Guru and the Vaiṣṇavas."],"isLong":false},{"number":"10","text":["śrī-guru-vaiṣṇava-pāda-padma kari āśa","(hari) nāma-saṅkīrtana kahe narottama dāsa"],"translation":["Aspiring for the lotus feet of Śrī Guru and the Vaiṣṇavas, Narottam Dās chants the Holy Name."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-hari-haraye","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/navadwip-scsm-hari-haraye","personSlug":"nabadwip-temple"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-xari-xaraje","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/hari-haraye-namah-krishna","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Bhakti Lalita Devi","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bhakti-lalita-devi/bhakti-lalita-devi-nama-sankirttan-hari-haraye-namah-krishna","personSlug":"bhakti-lalita-devi"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Nām-saṅkīrtan-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/hari-haraye-namah-krishna-yadavaya-namah/","description":"Nām-saṅkīrtan — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Nām-saṅkīrtan. by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"hari-haraye-namah-krishna-yadavaya-namah"}}